<GameData>
  <LocalizedText>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAP_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>组队PVP富饶大陆</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAP_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>富饶竖向主大陆、丰富岛屿和海洋资源、地图道路；恢复横向条状大陆划分，默认东西分队，并为海洋文明与俄罗斯提供出生保底。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_FFA_MAP_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>FFA富饶大陆</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_FFA_MAP_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN"><Text>适合2至12人混战的富饶大陆；全宽画布等比扩展东西海域与陆地，不强制中央深海；普通地理大陆划分，最终山地约占陆地3.5%，并提供出生保底。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAP_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>Team PVP Rich Mainland</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_TEAM_MAP_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>A rich vertical mainland with islands, ocean resources and prebuilt routes; restores horizontal continent bands, defaults to east-west teams, and protects ocean and Russian starts.</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_FFA_MAP_NAME" Language="en_US"><Text>FFA Rich Mainland</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_ZYLRM_FFA_MAP_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US"><Text>A 2-12 player free-for-all map whose full widened canvas proportionally expands land and east/west seas without a forced central deep ocean; uses geographic continents, a final mountain share near 3.5%, and protected starts.</Text></Row>

